  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing mince old monster Hei Shi with a beast phantom and reveal rank four aura, watchers in the dark gasp that both youths are rank four and name them black and white twin demons, with Fang Zheng called little beast king from Shang clan city’s battle stage. Fang Yuan is not satisfied; he shifts his mind and sends another beast phantom into a specific shadow. A huge sound follows as the demonic Gu Master hiding there becomes meat paste. From the darkness someone cries that Jin Cheng En also died. Other voices call little beast king murderous for not sparing spectators. Trees shake and stones lift as countless shadows scuttle away; Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing quietly watch and do not block them.",
